    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Cronos",
    "summary": "When you pick this unit to shoot during your Shooting phase or to fight during the Fight phase, you can Empower it by paying a single token from [Power From Pain](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). After its attacks resolve while Empowered, check whether they destroyed any enemy models. If they did, one Cronos model recovers up to 3 wounds it has lost. If every surviving model is at full health and the unit is below Starting Strength, return one destroyed model with 3 wounds.",
